# Canonical site origin used for canonical URLs, Open Graph, sitemap and JSON-LD.
# Defaults to https://hustontech.com (domain not yet confirmed). No secrets belong here.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://hustontech.com

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Where secrets live. This file is committed: NEVER put a real value in it.
# Names only. The contact form does not exist yet; these are placeholders
# for later and are commented out so nothing here defines a variable.
#
#   Local development : .dev.vars in the repo root (git-ignored, never committed)
#   Production        : Cloudflare Workers > Variables and secrets
#   CI                : GitHub Actions secrets
#
# Secrets the contact form will need:
#   EMAIL_SERVICE_API_KEY               email service API key
#   GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_CREDENTIALS  Google service-account credentials
#   TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY                Cloudflare Turnstile secret key
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
